<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia prices flat in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia prices flat in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia values were unchanged in slow dealings that are typical for this time of year, cash soruces said.</p>
<p>&quot;All we can do right now is sit back and watch the corn grow,&quot; one dealer said. &quot;The next thing up is getting ready for next year.&quot;</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Monday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172		     unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  186-188		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		165-175		 unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
